ion":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Y extenderá su mano sobre el norte, y destruirá a Asiria, y convertirá a Nínive en asolamiento y en sequedal como un desierto.","strongTokens":[{"word":"extenderá","strong":"5186"},{"word":"mano","strong":"3027"},{"word":"sobre","strong":"5921"},{"word":"norte","strong":"6828"},{"word":"destruirá","strong":"6"},{"word":"Asiria","strong":"804"},{"word":"Asiria","strong":"7760"},{"word":"Nínive","strong":"5210"},{"word":"asolamiento","strong":"8077"},{"word":"sequedal","strong":"6723"},{"word":"desierto","strong":"4057"}]},{"bookId":"ZEP","chapter":2,"verse":14,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Rebaños de ganado harán en ella majada, todas las bestias del campo; el pelícano también y el erizo dormirán en sus dinteles; su voz cantará en las ventanas; habrá desolación en las puertas, porque su enmaderamiento de cedro será descubierto.","strongTokens":[{"word":"en","strong":"7257"},{"word":"majada","strong":"8432"},{"word":"todas","strong":"5739"},{"word":"las","strong":"3605"},{"word":"del","strong":"2416"},{"word":"el","strong":"1471"},{"word":"también","strong":"6893"},{"word":"y","strong":"1571"},{"word":"el","strong":"1571"},{"word":"dormirán","strong":"7090"},{"word":"su","strong":"3730"},{"word":"su","strong":"3885"},{"word":"cantará","strong":"6963"},{"word":"cantará","strong":"7891"},{"word":"habrá","strong":"2474"},{"word":"en","strong":"2721"},{"word":"porque","strong":"5592"},{"word":"su","strong":"3588"},{"word":"descubierto","strong":"731"},{"word":"descubierto","strong":"6168"}]},{"bookId":"ZEP","chapter":2,"verse":15,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Esta es la ciudad alegre que estaba confiada, la que decía en su corazón: Yo, y no, más. ¡Cómo fue asolada, hecha guarida de fieras! Cualquiera que pasare junto a ella, se burlará y sacudirá su mano.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Esta","strong":"2063"},{"word":"ciudad","strong":"5892"},{"word":"alegre","strong":"5947"},{"word":"estaba","strong":"3427"},{"word":"estaba","strong":"983"},{"word":"decía","strong":"559"},{"word":"corazón","strong":"3824"},{"word":"Yo","strong":"589"},{"word":"no","strong":"657"},{"word":"más","strong":"5750"},{"word":"Cómo","strong":"349"},{"word":"fue","strong":"1961"},{"word":"fue","strong":"8047"},{"word":"guarida","strong":"4769"},{"word":"fieras","strong":"2416"},{"word":"Cualquiera","strong":"3605"},{"word":"pasare","strong":"5674"},{"word":"junto","strong":"5921"},{"word":"burlará","strong":"8319"},{"word":"burlará","strong":"5128"},{"word":"mano","strong":"3027"}]}],"3":[{"bookId":"ZEP","chapter":3,"verse":1,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"¡Ay de la ciudad rebelde y contaminada y opresora!","strongTokens":[{"word":"Ay","strong":"1945"},{"word":"Ay","strong":"4754"},{"word":"ciudad","strong":"5892"},{"word":"contaminada","strong":"1351"},{"word":"opresora","strong":"3238"}]},{"bookId":"ZEP","chapter":3,"verse":2,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"No escuchó la voz, ni recibió la corrección; no confió en Jehová, no se acercó a su Dios.","strongTokens":[{"word":"No","strong":"3808"},{"word":"escuchó","strong":"8085"},{"word":"voz","strong":"6963"},{"word":"ni","strong":"3808"},{"word":"recibió","strong":"3947"},{"word":"corrección","strong":"4148"},{"word":"no","strong":"3808"},{"word":"confió","strong":"982"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"no","strong":"3808"},{"word":"acercó","strong":"7126"},{"word":"a","strong":"413"},{"word":"a","strong":"430"}]},{"bookId":"ZEP","chapter":3,"verse":3,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Sus príncipes en medio de ella son leones rugientes; sus jueces, lobos nocturnos que no dejan hueso para la mañana.","strongTokens":[{"word":"príncipes","strong":"8269"},{"word":"medio","strong":"7130"},{"word":"leones","strong":"738"},{"word":"rugientes","strong":"7580"},{"word":"jueces","strong":"8199"},{"word":"lobos","strong":"2061"},{"word":"noctu