rd":"quedar","strong":"1097"},{"word":"sus","strong":"5674"},{"word":"están","strong":"5892"},{"word":"hasta","strong":"6658"},{"word":"quedar","strong":"1097"},{"word":"hasta","strong":"376"},{"word":"quedar","strong":"369"},{"word":"quedar","strong":"3427"}]},{"bookId":"ZEP","chapter":3,"verse":7,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Dije: Ciertamente me temerá; recibirá corrección, y no será destruida su morada según todo aquello por lo cual la, castigué. Mas ellos se apresuraron a corromper todos sus hechos.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Dije","strong":"559"},{"word":"Ciertamente","strong":"389"},{"word":"temerá","strong":"3372"},{"word":"recibirá","strong":"3947"},{"word":"corrección","strong":"4148"},{"word":"no","strong":"3808"},{"word":"destruida","strong":"3772"},{"word":"destruida","strong":"4585"},{"word":"todo","strong":"3605"},{"word":"todo","strong":"5949"},{"word":"la","strong":"834"},{"word":"castigué","strong":"5921"},{"word":"Mas","strong":"6485"},{"word":"ellos","strong":"403"},{"word":"a","strong":"7925"},{"word":"todos","strong":"7843"},{"word":"sus","strong":"3605"}]},{"bookId":"ZEP","chapter":3,"verse":8,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Por tanto, esperadme, , dice Jehová, hasta el día que me levante para juzgaros; porque mi determinación es reunir las naciones, juntar los reinos, para derramar sobre ellos mi enojo, todo el ardor de mi ira; por el fuego de mi celo será consumida toda la tierra.","strongTokens":[{"word":"esperadme","strong":"3651"},{"word":"esperadme","strong":"2442"},{"word":"dice","strong":"5002"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"día","strong":"3117"},{"word":"día","strong":"6965"},{"word":"juzgaros","strong":"5706"},{"word":"porque","strong":"3588"},{"word":"determinación","strong":"4941"},{"word":"determinación","strong":"622"},{"word":"naciones","strong":"1471"},{"word":"naciones","strong":"6908"},{"word":"reinos","strong":"4467"},{"word":"derramar","strong":"8210"},{"word":"sobre","strong":"5921"},{"word":"enojo","strong":"2195"},{"word":"todo","strong":"3605"},{"word":"ardor","strong":"2740"},{"word":"ira","strong":"639"},{"word":"ira","strong":"3588"},{"word":"fuego","strong":"784"},{"word":"celo","strong":"7068"},{"word":"consumida","strong":"398"},{"word":"toda","strong":"3605"},{"word":"tierra","strong":"776"}]},{"bookId":"ZEP","chapter":3,"verse":9,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"En aquel tiempo devolveré yo a los pueblos pureza de labios, para que todos, invoquen el nombre de Jehová, para que le sirvan de común consentimiento.","strongTokens":[{"word":"En","strong":"3588"},{"word":"tiempo","strong":"227"},{"word":"devolveré","strong":"2015"},{"word":"a","strong":"413"},{"word":"pueblos","strong":"5971"},{"word":"pureza","strong":"1305"},{"word":"labios","strong":"8193"},{"word":"todos","strong":"3605"},{"word":"invoquen","strong":"7121"},{"word":"nombre","strong":"8034"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"sirvan","strong":"5647"},{"word":"común","strong":"259"},{"word":"consentimiento","strong":"7926"}]},{"bookId":"ZEP","chapter":3,"verse":10,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"De la región más allá de los ríos de Etiopía me suplicarán; la hija de mis esparcidos traerá mi ofrenda.","strongTokens":[{"word":"más","strong":"5676"},{"word":"ríos","strong":"5104"},{"word":"Etiopía","strong":"3568"},{"word":"suplicarán","strong":"6282"},{"word":"hija","strong":"1323"},{"word":"hija","strong":"6327"},{"word":"traerá","strong":"2986"},{"word":"ofrenda","strong":"4503"}]},{"bookId":"ZEP","chapter":3,"verse":11,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"En aquel día no serás avergonzada por ninguna de tus obras con que te rebelaste contra mí; porque entonces quitaré de en medio de ti a los que se alegran en tu soberbia, y nunca más te ensoberbecerás en mi santo monte.","strongTokens":[{"word":"no","strong":"3117"},{"word":"no","strong":"3808"},{"word":"no","strong":"1931"},{"